      'Heading, body, and code stacks. Tokens marked [TW] are Tailwind aliases needed when you @apply utility classes.',
    css: `--font-heading: "Instrument Sans", system-ui, sans-serif;
--font-body:    "Source Sans 3", system-ui, sans-serif;
--font-code:    ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
--font-sans:    "Source Sans 3", system-ui, sans-serif;    /* [TW] */
--font-mono:    ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; /* [TW] */`,
  },
  {
    id: 'radii',
    name: 'Radii',
    count: '7',
    blurb:
      'Three semantic radii plus four Tailwind aliases. Override the [TW] tokens too if you @apply rounded utilities.',
